# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Without this, files edited on a Windows machine get rewritten with CRLF,
# which makes every file show as modified and floods diffs with pure
# whitespace changes. See PHILOSOPHY.md: everywhere "consistency beats
# technically-better"; line endings are stored as LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Gradle wrapper JAR is a binary; do not treat it as text.
*.jar binary
